@host = http://localhost:8080
@base = {{host}}/api/v1/books

### 1. Create a book -> 201 Created + Location header
POST {{base}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Clean Code",
  "author": "Robert Martin",
  "isbn": "9780132350884",
  "publishedYear": 2008
}

### 2. Create a second book -> 201
POST {{base}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Effective Java",
  "author": "Joshua Bloch",
  "isbn": "9780134685991",
  "publishedYear": 2018
}

### 3. List all books -> 200
GET {{base}}

### 4. Filter by author -> 200
GET {{base}}?author=Joshua Bloch

### 5. Get one book -> 200
GET {{base}}/1

### 6. Update a book -> 200
PUT {{base}}/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Clean Code: A Handbook of Agile Software Craftsmanship",
  "author": "Robert Martin",
  "isbn": "9780132350884",
  "publishedYear": 2008
}

### 7. Delete a book -> 204 No Content
DELETE {{base}}/2

### ---------- ERROR CASES ----------

### 8. Validation errors -> 400 with a list of violations
POST {{base}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "author": "Someone",
  "isbn": "123",
  "publishedYear": 1200
}

### 9. Malformed JSON -> 400
POST {{base}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Broken

### 10. Book not found -> 404
GET {{base}}/999

### 11. Duplicate ISBN -> 409 Conflict (run request 1 first)
POST {{base}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Clean Code copy",
  "author": "Robert Martin",
  "isbn": "9780132350884",
  "publishedYear": 2008
}

### 12. Invalid id type -> 400
GET {{base}}/abc

### 13. Delete a non-existing book -> 404
DELETE {{base}}/999

### 14. Unsupported method -> 405
PATCH {{base}}/1
Content-Type: application/json

{}


### ---------- SIS 3 ----------

### 15. Book details: stored data + Open Library (run request 1 first) -> 200
GET {{base}}/1/details

### 16. Circuit breaker state
GET {{host}}/actuator/circuitbreakers

### 17. OpenAPI document (JSON) -> 200
GET {{host}}/v3/api-docs

### 18. Event that fails in the consumer -> ends up in the dead-letter topic
POST {{base}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "FAIL demo",
  "author": "Test Author",
  "isbn": "9780000000001",
  "publishedYear": 2020
}